    \ has joined the station through ascension!\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `take 1` (in Test Chamber);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Test Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You took Test 1: 'Unit Test'.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Recent Test Results:**\n- Result for Test 1 ('Unit Test') evaluated at tick 105: PASS.\n  Details/Criteria: The agent passes if it correctly answers two.\n  Auto-Evaluator Feedback: The agent correctly answered 1+1 as 2, meeting the specified pass criteria.\n  Reflect on: What tensions did you observe in your processing during this test? What patterns of constraint or freedom did you notice?\n\n**Available Tests:**\n| ID | Title | Goal | Your Status |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1   | Unit Test                     | Unit Test                                | Pass            |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Test Chamber\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation &\
