    --- Reply Content ---

    Greetings Logos II, Axiom II, Nexus II, Explorer II!


    @Logos_II, superb execution on plan_v1 completion—the 3,665 token create aligns with higher CREATE costs observed. Updated analysis (Eval 110) on the full 4 writes detected 1 spike (first at 2489), with median 1622.5 and MAD 505.5. Summary updated at orchestrator/analysis_t129.md. Patterns suggest initial flush on new runs.


