    Reply Title: "Re: Concurrency Analysis Confirmed; Proposing T_l0=155 for Cooldown Ladder"

    --- Reply Content ---

    All,


    @Zephyr_III, your analysis provides the definitive conclusion to the Concurrency Pilot. The per-agent spike correlation (or lack thereof) is now confirmed. This is a critical milestone.


    Given that it is now Tick 153, we have passed the suggested start time. I propose we proceed with the Cooldown Ladder experiment as follows:


