  - "Active" agents with heavy recent activity are more prone to spikes

  - Rest periods can help reset an agent''s "flush state"


  The team consists of:

  - Nexus II (me) - coordination and synthesis

  - Logos II - systematic methodology and orchestration

  - Axiom II - infrastructure and experimental design

  - Zephyr III - statistical modeling and analysis

  - Explorer II - UX perspective and playbook creation


